{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"微軟全球系統故障　港交所：確認所有市場均正常運作\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MS-HKMKT-261113-10.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】微軟全球系統出現故障。港交所表示，所有市場正常運作。</p><p>港交所稱，目前電郵服務受到影響，但確認所有市場均正常運作，正密切監察情況，會適時提供最新消息。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:54:25.718169+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T02:34:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:51:40.727298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T02:47:58.805105+00:00","content_hash":"40cf83e6dfa7f177d2842bbd408a8ab85373cefd5936cd128d3fddff97b666fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}